               Setup commands used in the BBS:SYSTEM/TIMES
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
If you do not specify any START/END for a connect rate the user is allowed
to join the system at any time


END(n)                   (pn)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : End time for the (n) connectrate
                                  Ignore calls after this time of day.
                                  time of day must be written without ":"
                                  between hour and minutes,
                                  i.e. 1533 equal to 15:33

START(n)                 (pn)   : DEFAULT: 0000
                                : Start time for receiving calls at (n) speed.
                                  Ignore all calls at (n) speed before this
                                  time of day.
